# TURNIP TRUCK: MOON RAID. Saucers of three sizes (one big, two middling,
# five small) wander the sky erratically and bomb where the truck is when
# they come near; a bomb that lands on it costs a heart.
seed 10
game turnip
wait 5
cheat day 3 6
cheat notraffic
expect saucers == 8
expect saucers_0 == 5
expect saucers_1 == 2
expect saucers_2 == 1
cheat pos 400 276
cheat stop
waituntil shots_1 >= 1 900
waituntil hit_by3 >= 1 900
# a bomb on target
cheat clearmobs
cheat hearts 3
cheat inv 0
cheat shot 1 400 276 400 200 10
wait 12
expect hearts == 2
